Scope

This license covers this repository's documentation and derived material
(README.md, SKILL.md, references/). The repository's source code
(scripts/) is released separately under the MIT License via LICENSE-CODE,
mirroring the upstream split.

The K12-KGraph dataset that this skill queries remains under its own
license (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, © 2026 K12-KGraph Authors) and is **not**
redistributed by this repository; you obtain it from
https://huggingface.co/datasets/lhpku20010120/K12-KGraph and use it under
the upstream terms. Any dataset extracts you share remain subject to the
upstream NonCommercial and ShareAlike conditions.

Rationale (mirroring upstream K12-KGraph)

The documentation embeds schema descriptions derived from K12-KGraph,
which draws from the People's Education Press (PEP) K-12 textbooks. The
NonCommercial clause prevents downstream commercial repackaging that could
create licensing conflicts; ShareAlike keeps improvements available to the
community.

